{"version":"0.1.0","license":"propriétaire","license_files":["MIT-hsk30.txt","UNICODE-LICENSE.txt","MIT-cjk-decomp.txt"],"source":"liste HSK 3.0 (GF 0025-2021) : caractères data/sources/listes/hsk-*.txt, mots data/sources/listes/hsk-mots.tsv (ivankra/hsk30, MIT) ; pinyin des caractères d'Unihan ; décomposition GF 0014-2009 réconciliée par le pipeline wenlu ; sens et exemples rédigés pour l'app et relus","source_url":"https://github.com/jon-gyt/zilin","modified":"2026-09-30 : assemblé par `wenlu export`","lot":48,"entrees":{"孝":{"c":"孝","pinyin":"xiào","lectures":["xiào"],"niveau":7,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["耂","子"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L7-4574","L7-4575"],"chemin":{"hsk":1355,"lire":1348},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"piété filiale ; deuil","acceptions":[{"categorie":"N","fr":"piété filiale"},{"categorie":"N","fr":"deuil, habits de deuil"}]},"exemples":[],"origine":null},"效":{"c":"效","pinyin":"xiào","lectures":["xiào"],"niveau":3,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["六","乂","𠂉","乂"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L3-0796","L3-0864","L4-0811","L5-0105","L6-0866","L7-0390","L7-1288","L7-1374","L7-2008","L7-2629","L7-3656","L7-3684","L7-4577","L7-4578","L7-4579","L7-4580","L7-5079","L7-5599"],"chemin":{"hsk":449,"lire":443},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"effet ; imiter","acceptions":[{"categorie":"N","fr":"effet, efficacité"},{"categorie":"V","fr":"imiter ; servir"}]},"exemples":[],"origine":null},"校":{"c":"校","pinyin":"xiào","lectures":["xiào","jiào"],"niveau":1,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["木","六","乂"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L1-0421","L2-0608","L2-0609","L7-4863"],"chemin":{"hsk":132,"lire":217},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"école","acceptions":[{"categorie":"N","fr":"école, établissement scolaire"}]},"exemples":[],"origine":{"statut":"relu","etiquette":"atteste","fr":"Le Shuowen jiezi glose 校 par « entraves de bois » : le bois, 木, et 交 pour le son. À droite, 交 s'écrit 六 sur 乂 ; il se lit jiāo, comme 校 dans le sens de « corriger ». Le sens « école » est venu ensuite, lu xiào ; 木 est resté à gauche.","en":"The Shuowen jiezi glosses 校 as “wooden shackles”: wood, 木, and 交 for the sound. On the right, 交 is written 六 over 乂; it is read jiāo, like 校 in the sense of “to proofread”. The meaning “school” came later, read xiào; 木 has stayed on the left.","roles":{"木":"sens","六":"forme","乂":"forme"}}},"笑":{"c":"笑","pinyin":"xiào","lectures":["xiào"],"niveau":1,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["⺮","夭"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L1-0191","L1-0408","L2-0610","L2-0611","L4-0748","L6-0891","L6-0892","L6-0893","L7-0413","L7-0489","L7-1295","L7-1594","L7-1658","L7-1749","L7-1849","L7-2391","L7-2444","L7-2450","L7-2558","L7-2814","L7-3383","L7-4424"],"chemin":{"hsk":185,"lire":218},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"rire, sourire ; se moquer de","acceptions":[{"categorie":"V","fr":"rire, sourire"},{"categorie":"V","fr":"se moquer de"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"她笑了。","pinyin":"Tā xiào le.","fr":"Elle a souri.","statut":"relu"},{"zh":"别笑我。","pinyin":"Bié xiào wǒ.","fr":"Ne te moque pas de moi.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":{"statut":"relu","etiquette":"mnemotechnique","fr":"Pour s'en souvenir : en haut, le bambou, ⺮, comme deux yeux plissés. En bas, 夭, un homme qui penche la tête. Les yeux plissés, la tête qui se renverse : c'est le rire.","en":"As a memory aid: at the top is bamboo, ⺮, like two screwed-up eyes. At the bottom is 夭, a man tilting his head. Screwed-up eyes and a head thrown back: that is laughter.","roles":{"⺮":"forme","夭":"forme"}}},"肖":{"c":"肖","pinyin":"xiào","lectures":["xiào","xiāo"],"niveau":7,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["⺌","月"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L7-4576"],"chemin":{"hsk":1352,"lire":1345},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"ressembler à","acceptions":[{"categorie":"V","fr":"ressembler à"},{"categorie":"N","fr":"nom de famille","pinyin":"xiāo"}]},"exemples":[],"origine":null},"些":{"c":"些","pinyin":"xiē","lectures":["xiē"],"niveau":1,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["止","匕","二"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L1-0253","L1-0258","L1-0439","L1-0445","L1-0468","L4-0812"],"chemin":{"hsk":120,"lire":110},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"quelques, un peu","acceptions":[]},"exemples":[{"zh":"我买了一些水果。","pinyin":"Wǒ mǎi le yīxiē shuǐguǒ.","fr":"J'ai acheté des fruits.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":{"statut":"relu","etiquette":"mnemotechnique","fr":"些 est absent du Shuowen jiezi original, et son origine reste discutée. On y voit 此, formé de 止 et de 匕, au-dessus de 二. Pour s'en souvenir : 此 veut dire « ceci » en chinois classique, et 二 ajoute qu'il y en a plus d'un, « quelques-uns ».","en":"些 is not in the original Shuowen jiezi, and its origin is still debated. It shows 此, made of 止 and 匕, above 二. To remember it: 此 means “this” in classical Chinese, and 二 adds that there is more than one, “some”.","roles":{"止":"sens","匕":"sens","二":"sens"}}},"歇":{"c":"歇","pinyin":"xiē","lectures":["xiē"],"niveau":5,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["日","勹","人","𠃊","欠"],"sources":["cjk-decomp","surcharge"]},"mots":["L5-0841"],"chemin":{"hsk":730,"lire":723},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"se reposer, faire une pause","acceptions":[{"categorie":"V","fr":"se reposer, faire une pause"},{"categorie":"V","fr":"s'arrêter, cesser"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"走累了，我们歇一会儿吧。","pinyin":"Zǒu lèi le, wǒmen xiē yīhuìr ba.","fr":"On est fatigués de marcher, soufflons un peu.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":null},"协":{"c":"协","pinyin":"xié","lectures":["xié"],"niveau":5,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["十","办"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L5-0842","L5-0843","L6-0894","L6-0895","L6-0896","L6-0897","L7-3185","L7-4221","L7-4581","L7-4582","L7-4583"],"chemin":{"hsk":731,"lire":724},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"aider, coopérer ; association","acceptions":[{"categorie":"V","fr":"aider, coopérer, s'entendre"},{"categorie":"N","fr":"association"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"他加入了作家协会。","pinyin":"Tā jiārù le zuòjiā xiéhuì.","fr":"Il est entré à l'association des écrivains.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":null},"挟":{"c":"挟","pinyin":"xié","lectures":["xié","jiā"],"niveau":7,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["扌","夹"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L7-4586"],"chemin":{"hsk":1356,"lire":1349},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"tenir sous le bras ; contraindre","acceptions":[{"categorie":"V","fr":"tenir sous le bras"},{"categorie":"V","fr":"contraindre, faire pression sur"}]},"exemples":[],"origine":null},"携":{"c":"携","pinyin":"xié","lectures":["xié"],"niveau":7,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["扌","隹","乃"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L7-4587","L7-4588"],"chemin":{"hsk":1357,"lire":1350},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"porter ; tenir par la main","acceptions":[{"categorie":"V","fr":"porter, emporter"},{"categorie":"V","fr":"tenir par la main"}]},"exemples":[],"origine":null},"斜":{"c":"斜","pinyin":"xié","lectures":["xié"],"niveau":5,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["人","干","小","斗"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L5-0844","L7-3335"],"chemin":{"hsk":731,"lire":724},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"oblique, penché, de travers","acceptions":[{"categorie":"Adj","fr":"oblique, penché, de travers"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"这张画挂斜了。","pinyin":"Zhè zhāng huà guà xié le.","fr":"Ce tableau n'est pas droit.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":null},"胁":{"c":"胁","pinyin":"xié","lectures":["xié"],"niveau":6,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["月","办"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L6-0856"],"chemin":{"hsk":866,"lire":859},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"flanc ; menacer","acceptions":[{"categorie":"N","fr":"flanc, côté"},{"categorie":"V","fr":"menacer, contraindre"}]},"exemples":[],"origine":null},"谐":{"c":"谐","pinyin":"xié","lectures":["xié"],"niveau":6,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["讠","匕","匕","白"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L6-0373"],"chemin":{"hsk":867,"lire":860},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"harmonieux ; plaisant","acceptions":[{"categorie":"Adj","fr":"harmonieux, en accord"},{"categorie":"Adj","fr":"plaisant, humoristique"}]},"exemples":[],"origine":null},"邪":{"c":"邪","pinyin":"xié","lectures":["xié","yé"],"niveau":7,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["牙","阝"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L7-1242","L7-4584","L7-4585"],"chemin":{"hsk":1356,"lire":1349},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"mauvais, pervers ; étrange","acceptions":[{"categorie":"Adj","fr":"mauvais, pervers"},{"categorie":"Adj","fr":"étrange, anormal : familier"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"这件事有点儿邪。","pinyin":"Zhè jiàn shì yǒudiǎnr xié.","fr":"Cette histoire est un peu louche.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":null},"鞋":{"c":"鞋","pinyin":"xié","lectures":["xié"],"niveau":2,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["革","土","土"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L2-0449","L2-0612","L5-0266","L5-0550","L6-0541","L6-0831","L7-0582"],"chemin":{"hsk":319,"lire":318},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"chaussure","acceptions":[{"categorie":"N","fr":"chaussure"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"我的鞋太小了。","pinyin":"Wǒ de xié tài xiǎo le.","fr":"Mes chaussures sont trop petites.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":{"statut":"relu","etiquette":"mnemotechnique","fr":"Pour s'en souvenir : à gauche, 革, le cuir. À droite, 圭, deux 土 empilés : la terre qu'on foule. Du cuir entre le pied et la terre : la chaussure.","en":"As a memory aid: on the left, 革, leather. On the right, 圭, two stacked 土: the ground one treads. Leather between the foot and the earth: a shoe.","roles":{}}},"写":{"c":"写","pinyin":"xiě","lectures":["xiě","xiè"],"niveau":1,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["冖","与"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L1-0364","L1-0409","L3-0797","L4-0078","L4-0521","L6-0898","L6-0899","L7-0180","L7-3805","L7-4089","L7-4589","L7-5502"],"chemin":{"hsk":209,"lire":172},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"écrire","acceptions":[]},"exemples":[{"zh":"你会写这个字吗？","pinyin":"Nǐ huì xiě zhège zì ma?","fr":"Tu sais écrire ce caractère ?","statut":"relu"}],"origine":{"statut":"relu","etiquette":"atteste","fr":"La forme traditionnelle, 寫, est pour le Shuowen jiezi un idéo-phonétique au sens de « déposer, placer un objet » : 宀, le toit, en donne le sens, 舃 le son. De « transférer », le sens est passé à « recopier », puis à « écrire ». La simplification, tirée de l'écriture cursive, a réduit 宀 à 冖 et remplacé 舃 par 与.","en":"The traditional form, 寫, is for the Shuowen jiezi a phonetic compound meaning “to set down, to place”: 宀, a roof, gives the meaning, 舃 the sound. From “to transfer”, the meaning moved to “to copy”, then to “to write”. The simplified form, taken from cursive script, reduced 宀 to 冖 and replaced 舃 with 与.","roles":{"冖":"forme","与":"forme"}}},"卸":{"c":"卸","pinyin":"xiè","lectures":["xiè"],"niveau":7,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["𦈢","卩"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L7-4196","L7-4596"],"chemin":{"hsk":1358,"lire":1351},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"décharger ; démonter","acceptions":[{"categorie":"V","fr":"décharger (des marchandises)"},{"categorie":"V","fr":"démonter, enlever ; se défaire de"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"工人们正在卸货。","pinyin":"Gōngrénmen zhèngzài xiè huò.","fr":"Les ouvriers vident le camion.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":null},"屑":{"c":"屑","pinyin":"xiè","lectures":["xiè"],"niveau":7,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["尸","⺌","月"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L7-0258"],"chemin":{"hsk":1359,"lire":1352},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"miettes, débris ; daigner","acceptions":[{"categorie":"N","fr":"miettes, débris"},{"categorie":"V","fr":"daigner : surtout à la négative"}]},"exemples":[],"origine":null},"懈":{"c":"懈","pinyin":"xiè","lectures":["xiè"],"niveau":7,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["忄","角","刀","牛"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L7-0259","L7-1964"],"chemin":{"hsk":1359,"lire":1352},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"relâché, négligent","acceptions":[{"categorie":"Adj","fr":"relâché, négligent"}]},"exemples":[],"origine":null},"械":{"c":"械","pinyin":"xiè","lectures":["xiè"],"niveau":6,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["木","戈","卄"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L6-0407","L7-3227"],"chemin":{"hsk":867,"lire":860},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"instrument, outil ; arme","acceptions":[{"categorie":"N","fr":"instrument, outil ; arme"}]},"exemples":[],"origine":null},"泄":{"c":"泄","pinyin":"xiè","lectures":["xiè"],"niveau":7,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["氵","世"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L7-1028","L7-4590","L7-4591","L7-4592","L7-4593","L7-4594","L7-4707"],"chemin":{"hsk":1357,"lire":1350},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"fuir, laisser échapper ; divulguer","acceptions":[{"categorie":"V","fr":"fuir, laisser échapper ; divulguer"},{"categorie":"V","fr":"épancher, décharger : colère"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"这个秘密不能泄出去。","pinyin":"Zhège mìmì bù néng xiè chuqu.","fr":"Ce secret ne doit pas s'ébruiter.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":null},"泻":{"c":"泻","pinyin":"xiè","lectures":["xiè"],"niveau":7,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["氵","冖","与"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L7-1231","L7-4595"],"chemin":{"hsk":1358,"lire":1351},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"couler à flots ; avoir la diarrhée","acceptions":[{"categorie":"V","fr":"couler à flots, se déverser"},{"categorie":"V","fr":"avoir la diarrhée"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"他吃坏了东西，泻了一天。","pinyin":"Tā chī huài le dōngxi, xiè le yī tiān.","fr":"Il a mangé quelque chose de mauvais et a été malade toute la journée.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":null},"谢":{"c":"谢","pinyin":"xiè","lectures":["xiè"],"niveau":1,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["讠","身","寸"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L1-0410","L2-0179","L7-4623"],"chemin":{"hsk":121,"lire":168},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"remercier","acceptions":[]},"exemples":[],"origine":{"statut":"relu","etiquette":"atteste","fr":"Le Shuowen jiezi range 谢 parmi les idéo-phonétiques : 言, la parole, devenu 讠, donne le sens, et 射, « tirer à l'arc », le son. 射 s'écrit avec 身 et 寸 et se lit aujourd'hui shè, qui ne sonne plus comme xiè. Le Shuowen glose 谢 par « prendre congé, décliner », et le sens a glissé vers les paroles qui remercient.","en":"The Shuowen jiezi classes 谢 as a phonetic compound: 言, speech, reduced to 讠, gives the meaning, and 射, “to shoot an arrow”, gives the sound. 射 is written with 身 and 寸 and now reads shè, which no longer sounds like xiè. The Shuowen glosses 谢 as “to take leave, to decline”, and the meaning drifted towards words of thanks.","roles":{"讠":"sens","身":"forme","寸":"forme"}}},"心":{"c":"心","pinyin":"xīn","lectures":["xīn"],"niveau":2,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":[],"sources":[]},"mots":["L2-0163","L2-0202","L2-0311","L2-0606","L2-0613","L2-0614","L2-0615","L2-0620","L2-0738","L3-0001","L3-0403","L3-0507","L3-0611","L3-0799","L4-0129","L4-0160","L4-0213","L4-0601","L4-0813","L4-0975","L5-0518","L5-0845","L5-0846","L5-0860","L6-0026","L6-0374","L6-0900","L6-0901","L6-0902","L6-0903","L6-0987","L6-1087","L7-0020","L7-0216","L7-0351","L7-0457","L7-0478","L7-0575","L7-0653","L7-0664","L7-0761","L7-0852","L7-0898","L7-0980","L7-1251","L7-1595","L7-1596","L7-1601","L7-1646","L7-1788","L7-2193","L7-2210","L7-2440","L7-2451","L7-2577","L7-2618","L7-2681","L7-3138","L7-3185","L7-3401","L7-3453","L7-3617","L7-3624","L7-3882","L7-3917","L7-3918","L7-3964","L7-3965","L7-4056","L7-4146","L7-4443","L7-4457","L7-4572","L7-4597","L7-4598","L7-4599","L7-4600","L7-4601","L7-4602","L7-4603","L7-4604","L7-4605","L7-4606","L7-4607","L7-4608","L7-4609","L7-4610","L7-4611","L7-4612","L7-4613","L7-4614","L7-4615","L7-4856","L7-4877","L7-4945","L7-4946","L7-5073","L7-5301","L7-5423","L7-5434","L7-5568","L7-5575"],"chemin":{"hsk":121,"lire":24},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"cœur, esprit, centre","acceptions":[]},"exemples":[{"zh":"他的心很好。","pinyin":"Tā de xīn hěn hǎo.","fr":"Il a bon cœur.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":{"statut":"relu","etiquette":"atteste","fr":"Sur les os oraculaires et les bronzes, 心 dessine le cœur, dont le contour laisse voir les cavités. Le Shuowen jiezi le classe parmi les pictogrammes et le place au centre du corps. Tenu pour le siège de la pensée et des sentiments, 心 entre dans de nombreux caractères de ce domaine, parfois réduit à 忄 sur la gauche.","en":"On oracle bones and bronzes, 心 draws the heart, its outline showing the chambers inside. The Shuowen jiezi counts it among the pictographs and places it at the center of the body. Held to be the seat of thought and feeling, 心 appears in many characters of that field, sometimes reduced to 忄 on the left.","roles":{}}},"新":{"c":"新","pinyin":"xīn","lectures":["xīn"],"niveau":1,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["立","一","小","斤"],"sources":["cjk-decomp","surcharge"]},"mots":["L1-0411","L1-0412","L2-0067","L2-0616","L3-0113","L4-0814","L4-0815","L4-0816","L4-0817","L5-0278","L6-0317","L6-0680","L6-0904","L6-0905","L7-1008","L7-1289","L7-1909","L7-3344","L7-3468","L7-3833","L7-4622","L7-4623","L7-4624","L7-4625","L7-4626","L7-4627","L7-4628","L7-4629","L7-4630","L7-5243"],"chemin":{"hsk":136,"lire":114},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"nouveau, neuf, récemment","acceptions":[]},"exemples":[{"zh":"我买了一本新书。","pinyin":"Wǒ mǎi le yī běn xīn shū.","fr":"J'ai acheté un nouveau livre.","statut":"relu"},{"zh":"他是新来的老师。","pinyin":"Tā shì xīn lái de lǎoshī.","fr":"C'est le nouveau professeur.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":{"statut":"relu","etiquette":"atteste","fr":"Dans les écritures anciennes, 新 associe une hache, 斤, à 辛 xīn, qui donne le son, et souvent à du bois, 木. Le Shuowen jiezi le glose par la coupe du bois ; ce sens est passé à 薪, le bois de chauffe, et 新 a gardé celui de « neuf », comme un bois fraîchement coupé. La partie gauche, 辛 posé sur 木, a le même tracé que 亲 et se décompose aujourd'hui en 立, 一 et 小.","en":"In early script, 新 combines an axe, 斤, with 辛 xīn for the sound, and often with wood, 木. The Shuowen jiezi glosses it as cutting wood; that sense passed to 薪, firewood, while 新 kept the meaning “new”, like freshly cut timber. The left side, 辛 set on 木, is drawn like 亲 and now breaks down into 立, 一 and 小.","roles":{"立":"son","一":"son","小":"son","斤":"sens"}}},"欣":{"c":"欣","pinyin":"xīn","lectures":["xīn"],"niveau":5,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["斤","欠"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L5-0848","L7-4619","L7-4620","L7-4621"],"chemin":{"hsk":732,"lire":725},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"joyeux, content","acceptions":[{"categorie":"Adj","fr":"joyeux, content"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"看到孩子长大了，妈妈很欣慰。","pinyin":"Kàndào háizi zhǎngdà le, māma hěn xīnwèi.","fr":"Voir son enfant grandir réjouit sa mère.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":null},"芯":{"c":"芯","pinyin":"xīn","lectures":["xīn","xìn"],"niveau":7,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["卄","心"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L7-4616"],"chemin":{"hsk":1360,"lire":1353},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"mèche ; cœur, noyau","acceptions":[{"categorie":"N","fr":"mèche (de lampe, de bougie)"},{"categorie":"N","fr":"cœur, noyau, âme (d'un objet)"}]},"exemples":[],"origine":null},"薪":{"c":"薪","pinyin":"xīn","lectures":["xīn"],"niveau":6,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["卄","立","一","小","斤"],"sources":["cjk-decomp","surcharge"]},"mots":["L6-0906","L7-3002"],"chemin":{"hsk":868,"lire":861},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"salaire ; bois de chauffage","acceptions":[{"categorie":"N","fr":"salaire"},{"categorie":"N","fr":"bois de chauffage"}]},"exemples":[],"origine":null},"辛":{"c":"辛","pinyin":"xīn","lectures":["xīn"],"niveau":5,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":[],"sources":[]},"mots":["L5-0847","L7-1975","L7-4617","L7-4618"],"chemin":{"hsk":490,"lire":483},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"piquant ; pénible, amer","acceptions":[{"categorie":"Adj","fr":"piquant (saveur)"},{"categorie":"Adj","fr":"pénible, dur, amer"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"老师们辛勤地工作。","pinyin":"Lǎoshīmen xīnqín de gōngzuò.","fr":"Les enseignants travaillent avec ardeur.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":null},"馨":{"c":"馨","pinyin":"xīn","lectures":["xīn"],"niveau":7,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["士","殳","𠃜","禾","日"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L7-4326"],"chemin":{"hsk":1360,"lire":1353},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"parfum, senteur","acceptions":[{"categorie":"N","fr":"parfum, senteur qui se répand"}]},"exemples":[],"origine":null},"信":{"c":"信","pinyin":"xìn","lectures":["xìn"],"niveau":2,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["亻","言"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L2-0141","L2-0594","L2-0617","L2-0618","L2-0619","L2-0620","L2-0621","L3-0720","L3-0800","L3-0801","L3-0802","L4-0089","L4-0749","L4-0988","L5-0344","L5-0457","L5-0502","L5-0849","L5-0850","L6-0907","L6-0908","L7-0076","L7-0859","L7-1351","L7-1638","L7-1708","L7-1968","L7-2392","L7-2973","L7-3411","L7-3627","L7-4285","L7-4631","L7-4632","L7-4633","L7-4634","L7-5568"],"chemin":{"hsk":320,"lire":120},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"lettre, croire, confiance","acceptions":[]},"exemples":[{"zh":"我给妈妈写了一封信。","pinyin":"Wǒ gěi māma xiě le yī fēng xìn.","fr":"J'ai écrit une lettre à maman.","statut":"relu"},{"zh":"我不信。","pinyin":"Wǒ bù xìn.","fr":"Je n'y crois pas.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":{"statut":"relu","etiquette":"atteste","fr":"Le Shuowen jiezi analyse 信 comme l'union de 人, l'homme, et de 言, la parole, et le glose par « sincère ». Un homme et sa parole : ce que l'on dit doit être tenu, d'où « croire » et « avoir confiance ». Le sens de « lettre » vient plus tard, du messager qui porte une parole digne de foi.","en":"The Shuowen jiezi analyses 信 as 人, a person, joined to 言, speech, and glosses it as “sincere”. A person and their word: what is said must be kept, hence “to believe” and “to trust”. The meaning “letter” came later, from the messenger carrying a trustworthy word.","roles":{"亻":"sens","言":"sens"}}},"衅":{"c":"衅","pinyin":"xìn","lectures":["xìn"],"niveau":7,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["血","半"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L7-4100"],"chemin":{"hsk":1361,"lire":1354},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"querelle, différend","acceptions":[{"categorie":"N","fr":"querelle, différend"}]},"exemples":[],"origine":null},"兴":{"c":"兴","pinyin":"xīng","lectures":["xīng","xìng"],"niveau":1,"decomposition":null,"mots":["L1-0116","L4-0263","L4-0818","L4-0824","L6-0905","L6-0909","L7-1220","L7-3524","L7-4635","L7-4636","L7-4637","L7-4650","L7-4651","L7-5308"],"chemin":{"hsk":220,"lire":190},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"joie, intérêt, prospérer","acceptions":[]},"exemples":[],"origine":{"statut":"relu","etiquette":"atteste","fr":"Sur les os oraculaires, 興, forme traditionnelle de 兴, montre quatre mains qui soulèvent ensemble un objet. Le Shuowen jiezi le définit par le fait de se lever, et l'analyse par les mains jointes et 同, l'effort commun. La forme simplifiée 兴 vient de la cursive : ⺍, 一 et 八 n'y portent ni sens ni son.","en":"On oracle bones, 興, the traditional form of 兴, shows four hands lifting an object together. The Shuowen jiezi defines it as rising, and analyses it as joined hands plus 同, a shared effort. The simplified 兴 comes from cursive script: ⺍, 一 and 八 carry neither meaning nor sound in it.","roles":{}}},"星":{"c":"星","pinyin":"xīng","lectures":["xīng"],"niveau":1,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["日","生"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L1-0413","L1-0414","L1-0415","L2-0383","L2-0622","L5-0791","L6-0316","L6-0670","L6-0980","L7-2286","L7-4239","L7-4395","L7-4638"],"chemin":{"hsk":18,"lire":14},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"étoile, vedette","acceptions":[]},"exemples":[],"origine":{"statut":"relu","etiquette":"atteste","fr":"Sur les os oraculaires, les étoiles sont figurées par de petits cercles ou carrés, parfois accompagnés de 生 qui note le son. Le Shuowen jiezi donne une forme à trois 日 au-dessus de 生, où ces cercles sont des étoiles et non le soleil, et fait de 生 le composant phonétique. L'écriture a réduit les trois cercles à un seul 日, et 生, qui donnait le son, se lit aujourd'hui shēng, qui ne sonne plus comme xīng.","en":"On oracle bones, stars are drawn as small circles or squares, sometimes joined by 生 to note the sound. The Shuowen jiezi gives a form with three 日 above 生, where the circles are stars rather than the sun, and treats 生 as the phonetic part. Writing has reduced the three circles to a single 日, while 生, which gave the sound, now reads shēng, which no longer sounds like xīng.","roles":{"日":"sens","生":"forme"}}},"猩":{"c":"猩","pinyin":"xīng","lectures":["xīng"],"niveau":7,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["犭","日","生"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L7-4639"],"chemin":{"hsk":1361,"lire":1354},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"grand singe, orang-outan","acceptions":[{"categorie":"N","fr":"grand singe, orang-outan"}]},"exemples":[],"origine":null},"腥":{"c":"腥","pinyin":"xīng","lectures":["xīng"],"niveau":7,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["月","日","生"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L7-4640"],"chemin":{"hsk":1362,"lire":1355},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"qui sent le poisson cru","acceptions":[{"categorie":"Adj","fr":"qui sent le poisson cru, la viande crue"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"这条鱼有点儿腥。","pinyin":"Zhè tiáo yú yǒudiǎnr xīng.","fr":"Ce poisson a une odeur un peu forte.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":null},"刑":{"c":"刑","pinyin":"xíng","lectures":["xíng"],"niveau":7,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["开","刂"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L7-4641"],"chemin":{"hsk":1362,"lire":1355},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"peine, châtiment","acceptions":[{"categorie":"N","fr":"peine, châtiment ; torture"}]},"exemples":[],"origine":null},"型":{"c":"型","pinyin":"xíng","lectures":["xíng"],"niveau":4,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["开","刂","土"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L4-0151","L4-0186","L4-0466","L4-0527","L4-0810","L4-0817","L4-0821","L4-0822","L4-0928","L7-0422","L7-0454","L7-1035","L7-2287","L7-3330","L7-4290","L7-5141","L7-5411","L7-5435","L7-5493"],"chemin":{"hsk":586,"lire":579},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"modèle, type","acceptions":[{"categorie":"N","fr":"modèle, type ; moule"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"你的血型是什么？","pinyin":"Nǐ de xuèxíng shì shénme?","fr":"Quel est ton groupe sanguin ?","statut":"relu"}],"origine":null},"形":{"c":"形","pinyin":"xíng","lectures":["xíng"],"niveau":3,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["开","彡"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L3-0804","L3-0805","L3-0806","L3-0807","L4-0819","L4-0820","L5-0196","L5-0604","L5-0852","L6-0046","L6-0911","L7-0959","L7-1865","L7-4176","L7-4240","L7-4386","L7-4387","L7-4645","L7-4646","L7-5000","L7-5144"],"chemin":{"hsk":450,"lire":443},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"forme, figure","acceptions":[{"categorie":"N","fr":"forme, figure ; corps, silhouette"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"这张桌子是长方形的。","pinyin":"Zhè zhāng zhuōzi shì chángfāngxíng de.","fr":"Cette table est rectangulaire.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":null},"行":{"c":"行","pinyin":"xíng","lectures":["xíng","háng","héng","hàng"],"niveau":1,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["彳","一","丁"],"sources":["surcharge"]},"mots":["L1-0416","L2-0042","L2-0296","L2-0306","L2-0365","L2-0368","L2-0623","L2-0624","L2-0625","L2-0673","L2-0674","L2-0752","L3-0193","L3-0283","L3-0467","L3-0646","L3-0803","L4-0057","L4-0310","L5-0227","L5-0776","L5-0851","L5-0949","L5-1005","L6-0146","L6-0273","L6-0612","L6-0732","L6-0772","L6-0810","L6-0814","L6-0910","L6-0962","L6-0992","L7-0233","L7-1575","L7-1576","L7-1577","L7-1581","L7-2393","L7-2732","L7-2983","L7-3133","L7-3284","L7-3422","L7-3444","L7-3693","L7-3741","L7-4126","L7-4232","L7-4497","L7-4642","L7-4643","L7-4644","L7-4775","L7-4872","L7-4948","L7-5569"],"chemin":{"hsk":128,"lire":219},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"aller ; ça va, d'accord ; rangée","acceptions":[{"categorie":"V","fr":"aller, marcher ; faire, agir"},{"categorie":"Adj","fr":"ça va, d'accord ; capable, doué"},{"categorie":"M","fr":"rangée, ligne","pinyin":"háng"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"行，我们明天见。","pinyin":"Xíng, wǒmen míngtiān jiàn.","fr":"D'accord, à demain.","statut":"relu"},{"zh":"你真行！","pinyin":"Nǐ zhēn xíng!","fr":"Tu es vraiment doué !","statut":"relu"}],"origine":{"statut":"relu","etiquette":"atteste","fr":"Sur les os oraculaires, 行 dessine un carrefour, deux rues qui se croisent. Le Shuowen jiezi le lit comme « la marche de l'homme » et le coupe en 彳 et 亍, le pas gauche et le pas droit. On le lit toujours : 彳 à gauche, puis 亍, écrit 一 sur 丁.","en":"On oracle bones, 行 shows a crossroads, two streets meeting. The Shuowen jiezi reads it as “a man walking” and splits it into 彳 and 亍, the left step and the right step. You still read it that way: 彳 on the left, then 亍, written 一 over 丁.","roles":{"彳":"sens","一":"sens","丁":"sens"}}},"醒":{"c":"醒","pinyin":"xǐng","lectures":["xǐng"],"niveau":4,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["酉","日","生"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L4-0587","L4-0702","L4-0823","L7-2194","L7-2308","L7-3937","L7-4647","L7-4648","L7-4649"],"chemin":{"hsk":586,"lire":579},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"se réveiller ; reprendre conscience","acceptions":[{"categorie":"V","fr":"se réveiller"},{"categorie":"V","fr":"reprendre conscience ; dessoûler"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"我早上六点就醒了。","pinyin":"Wǒ zǎoshang liù diǎn jiù xǐng le.","fr":"J'avais les yeux ouverts dès six heures du matin.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":null},"姓":{"c":"姓","pinyin":"xìng","lectures":["xìng"],"niveau":2,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["女","生"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L2-0626","L2-0627","L3-0429","L7-4659"],"chemin":{"hsk":320,"lire":14},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"nom de famille, avoir pour nom","acceptions":[]},"exemples":[{"zh":"你姓什么？","pinyin":"Nǐ xìng shénme?","fr":"Quel est ton nom de famille ?","statut":"relu"},{"zh":"我姓王。","pinyin":"Wǒ xìng Wáng.","fr":"Je m'appelle Wang.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":{"statut":"relu","etiquette":"atteste","fr":"Le Shuowen jiezi explique 姓 comme ce dont une personne est née, et l'analyse comme 女, la femme, avec 生, naître. 生 en donnait aussi le son, mais shēng ne sonne plus comme xìng. Dans la Chine ancienne, 姓 désignait le nom du clan ; il signifie aujourd'hui « nom de famille » et, comme verbe, « avoir pour nom de famille ».","en":"The Shuowen jiezi explains 姓 as what a person is born from, and analyzes it as 女, woman, together with 生, to be born. 生 also gave the sound, but shēng no longer sounds like xìng. In ancient China 姓 named the clan; today it means “surname”, and as a verb “to be surnamed”.","roles":{"女":"sens","生":"sens"}}},"幸":{"c":"幸","pinyin":"xìng","lectures":["xìng"],"niveau":3,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["土","丷","干"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L3-0808","L3-0809","L5-0054","L7-3360","L7-3471","L7-4652","L7-4653","L7-4654","L7-4655","L7-5080"],"chemin":{"hsk":450,"lire":444},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"chance, bonheur ; heureusement","acceptions":[{"categorie":"N","fr":"chance, bonheur"},{"categorie":"Adv","fr":"heureusement, par chance"}]},"exemples":[],"origine":null},"性":{"c":"性","pinyin":"xìng","lectures":["xìng"],"niveau":3,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["忄","生"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L3-0231","L3-0810","L3-0811","L3-0812","L4-0825","L5-0519","L5-0533","L5-0752","L5-0853","L6-0949","L7-0146","L7-0998","L7-1265","L7-1362","L7-1390","L7-1476","L7-1890","L7-2575","L7-2619","L7-2792","L7-2962","L7-3445","L7-3462","L7-3822","L7-3979","L7-4003","L7-4081","L7-4656","L7-4657","L7-4658","L7-4814","L7-4961","L7-4980","L7-5001","L7-5412"],"chemin":{"hsk":451,"lire":444},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"nature, caractère ; sexe ; -ité","acceptions":[{"categorie":"Suffix","fr":"suffixe de qualité : -ité, -isme (motivation)"},{"categorie":"N","fr":"nature, caractère"},{"categorie":"N","fr":"s